499
01:50:14.106 --> 01:50:15.106
Pray in secret.

500
01:50:17.106 --> 01:50:18.106
Pray in hiding.

501
01:50:20.106 --> 01:50:21.106
Pray when we are together.

502
01:50:23.106 --> 01:50:24.106
We are a praying church.

503
01:50:25.106 --> 01:50:26.106
And we do that together.

504
01:50:27.106 --> 01:50:28.106
Amen.

505
01:50:29.106 --> 01:50:31.106
And the Lord looks at it and sees the lamp burning.

506
01:50:33.106 --> 01:50:35.106
So I want you to stand. We are going to pray now.

507
01:50:43.106 --> 01:50:46.106
Threaten yourself so you can see the lamp.

508
01:50:49.106 --> 01:50:52.106
So that you can live with Him and let your life be interrupted by Him.

509
01:50:58.106 --> 01:51:00.106
Be a brightly shining lamp.

510
01:51:01.106 --> 01:51:03.106
Be a brightly shining lamp.

511
01:51:08.106 --> 01:51:11.106
And say goodbye to what dims your light.

512
01:51:14.106 --> 01:51:17.106
And that can be a thousand different things in this room.

513
01:51:17.106 --> 01:51:18.106
Some are extensive sins.

514
01:51:19.106 --> 01:51:24.106
Some are small things that ruin your spirit and your mind.

515
01:51:32.106 --> 01:51:33.106
And then pray and seek the Lord.

516
01:51:34.106 --> 01:51:35.106
But pray carefully.

517
01:51:36.106 --> 01:51:37.106
Pray with an urgent heart.

518
01:51:38.106 --> 01:51:39.106
And pray continuously.

519
01:51:40.106 --> 01:51:41.106
That is what Paul says.

520
01:51:41.106 --> 01:51:42.106
And pray and seek the Lord.

521
01:51:43.106 --> 01:51:44.106
Seek Him with your whole heart.

522
01:51:47.106 --> 01:51:48.106
So Lord, we want to come before You.

523
01:51:53.106 --> 01:51:54.106
Lord, we want to come before You.

524
01:51:59.106 --> 01:52:01.106
We want to thank You for the way You prepare us.

525
01:52:02.106 --> 01:52:07.106
For those who are here, who have forgiven our sins through the slain lamb, we are in the kingdom.

526
01:52:16.106 --> 01:52:19.106
And our preparation is to receive the king and judge.

527
01:52:23.106 --> 01:52:26.106
It is to be clean and without guilt on that day.

528
01:52:31.106 --> 01:52:32.106
To stand before Him without sin.

529
01:52:38.106 --> 01:52:40.106
So Lord, I pray that You show us again.

530
01:52:45.106 --> 01:52:50.106
Would You touch our minds again to place our focus on You?

531
01:52:53.106 --> 01:52:57.106
Lord, would You bring that scattered mind back together?

532
01:52:58.106 --> 01:53:01.106
Lord, would You bring focus for the Lord in 2025?

533
01:53:07.106 --> 01:53:10.106
Lord, make each of us a brightly shining lamp.

534
01:53:18.106 --> 01:53:24.106
And I pray that as You look at Lommel, You will choose a brightly shining lamp.

535
01:53:27.106 --> 01:53:37.106
Lord, thank You that prayer would arise and that You will see a city filled with light on the hill.

536
01:53:41.106 --> 01:53:44.106
Lord, that the atmosphere over a whole region changes.

537
01:53:47.106 --> 01:53:49.106
The light that pierces the darkness.

538
01:53:49.106 --> 01:53:58.106
That is the power of the spirit of Christ that comes from the believers.

539
01:54:02.106 --> 01:54:06.106
Lord, so give us faith. Renew our faith in prayer.

540
01:54:09.106 --> 01:54:17.106
And for those who have given up on believing in prayer, I pray that they will see truly again.

541
01:54:19.106 --> 01:54:25.106
Those who have become hopeless, I pray that they will see the lamp again.

542
01:54:29.106 --> 01:54:32.106
That we will see you and that we will respond in the right way.

543
01:54:34.106 --> 01:54:36.106
Lord, make us a city on the hill.

544
01:54:39.106 --> 01:54:41.106
For your glory and for your name.

